<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:b86af44e-33ca-4ffc-addb-799de20df7b6">
              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIp</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the TcpIp (TCP/IP stack) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIp配置项是AUTOSAR通信协议栈的一部分，它定义了TCP/IP协议栈的参数，包括IP地址、子网掩码、默认网关等，以实现网络通信功能。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIp模块时，需要确保IP地址的唯一性和正确性，避免网络冲突；子网掩码应正确配置以确保网络分割的正确性；默认网关应当设置为能够访问网关的地址。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00001</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d628e34a-4e3f-451e-bb32-740bb768432d">
                  <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters and sub containers of the AUTOSAR TcpIp module.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpConfig 是用于配置TCP/IP协议栈的参数，包括IP地址、子网掩码、默认网关等，以及与网络相关的各种协议和服务的设置。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpConfig时，需要确保IP地址分配不会与网络中的其他设备冲突；子网掩码应正确反映网络的拓扑结构。AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能会对某些参数的取值范围或者配置方式有特定要求，需要根据标准文档进行配置。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00003</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:af0aade9-4d18-49bd-b7ce-f1136365af15">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpBufferMemoryConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the EthIf controller used for IP communication.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpBufferMemoryConfig 是用于配置TCP/IP协议栈中用于存储网络数据的缓冲区内存的参数，包括缓冲区的大小和数量。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpBufferMemoryConfig时，需要确保为网络通信预留足够的缓冲区内存，以避免数据丢失或通信延迟；同时，过多的缓冲区分配可能会导致系统资源的浪费；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，应当遵循模块配置规范来设置这些参数，以确保网络模块的正确运行和性能优化。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00021</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1d85c217-4c81-4653-b137-b7d218d0baa0">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpBufferMemoryLen</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the default value for the priority for all outgoing frames.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpBufferMemoryLen定义了TCP/IP协议栈用于存储网络数据的缓冲区大小，这个参数直接影响到网络通信的效率和稳定性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：缓冲区大小需要根据实际网络通信量和系统资源合理配置，过小可能导致数据丢失，过大可能浪费系统资源；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项与系统内存管理策略相协调；调整此参数时，应考虑系统的最大网络负载和并发连接数。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Note: the value can be changed for each socket individually via TcpIp_ChangeParameter() service. If this optional parameter is not available, 0 is used as default priority.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00081</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1d85c217-4c81-4653-b137-b7d218d0baa0">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpBufferMemoryNum</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the default value for the priority for all outgoing frames.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpBufferMemoryNum 是一个配置参数，用于指定TCP/IP协议栈中用于存储网络数据的特定长度缓冲区数量。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpBufferMemoryNum时，需要确保分配的缓冲区数量能够满足系统的网络通信需求；过多的缓冲区可能会导致系统资源的浪费，而过少则可能导致网络通信的延迟或丢包；此外，该参数的配置应考虑到系统的内存资源限制和预期的网络负载。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Note: the value can be changed for each socket individually via TcpIp_ChangeParameter() service. If this optional parameter is not available, 0 is used as default priority.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00081</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:af0aade9-4d18-49bd-b7ce-f1136365af15">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpCtrl</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the EthIf controller used for IP communication.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpCtrl配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈的控制器属性，包括但不限于IP地址配置、子网掩码、默认网关等网络参数，以实现网络通信的基本要求。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpCtrl时，必须确保IP地址的唯一性和正确性，避免网络冲突；子网掩码和默认网关的配置应符合实际网络架构要求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于IPv6的支持可能有特定限制，需仔细参考标准文档。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00021</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1d85c217-4c81-4653-b137-b7d218d0baa0">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpIpFramePrioDefault</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the default value for the priority for all outgoing frames.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpIpFramePrioDefault配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中，发送IP帧时默认使用的网络优先级。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值应当符合网络的QoS（Quality of Service）要求；在不同网络环境下，可能需要调整该值以优化网络性能；该配置项的设置应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对网络优先级的相关规定。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Note: the value can be changed for each socket individually via TcpIp_ChangeParameter() service. If this optional parameter is not available, 0 is used as default priority.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00081</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
