                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:45ea0bec-d7c0-40ca-9668-d730f81f5d71">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpDhcpServerConfigRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a TcpIpDhcpServerConfig which shall be used for this controller setting (VLAN).</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpDhcpServerConfigRef 是一个配置参考，它指向一个特定的DHCP服务器配置，该配置定义了TCP/IP协议栈中DHCP服务器的行为和属性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpDhcpServerConfigRef时，必须确保它指向的DHCP服务器配置是有效的并且已经定义；此配置项对于实现网络管理功能至关重要，因此需要仔细检查其正确性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保遵循了正确的模块间引用机制和数据约束。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00195</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
