                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/TcpIp/TcpIpConfig/TcpIpIpConfig/TcpIpIpV6Config/TcpIpIpV6ConfigExtHeaderFilter</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2096e675-3b6b-4e87-b9ad-4dfe318f73bc">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpAddrAssignment</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container is a subcontainer of TcpIpLocalAddr and specifies the assignment policy for the IP address.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpAddrAssignment 配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中网络接口的IP地址分配机制，包括静态配置、DHCP、LinkLocal（如IPv4的APIPA）或者SLAAC（无状态地址自动配置，用于IPv6）等方式。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpAddrAssignment时，需要确保所选的地址分配方式与网络环境和应用需求相匹配；对于静态地址配置，必须保证IP地址的唯一性和正确性；在使用DHCP或SLAAC时，应确保网络中存在相应的服务器或代理以支持地址分配过程。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00033</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d5dc2e2d-122b-4dff-a8e2-a20cf72e1c92">
                              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpAssignmentLifetime</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the lifetime of a dynamically fetched IP address.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpAssignmentLifetime 配置项定义了TCP/IP协议栈中动态分配的IP地址的租约时间，即该地址在没有续租的情况下可以保留多久。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置动态IP地址时，需要确保租约时间与网络中的DHCP服务器设置相匹配；租约时间过短可能导致频繁的IP地址续租，增加网络负载；租约时间过长可能导致IP地址资源不足，影响新设备的接入。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">TCPIP_FORGET</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">If TcpIpAssignmentMethod = TCPIP_STATIC then TcpIpAssignmentLifetime shall be omitted.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00186</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>TCPIP_FORGET</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:42661665-a616-9b76-6ec9-b3b957492fa6">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TCPIP_FORGET</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:95283850-b450-996e-4a9b-a29f8d5ab20c">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TCPIP_STORE</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:97bab381-6c72-4fc8-8f5d-6f147c700c1c">
                              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpAssignmentMethod</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Method of address assignment</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpAssignmentMethod 配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中网络接口的IP地址分配方法，例如静态分配、动态分配或者通过LinkLocal地址分配。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保选择的IP地址分配方法与系统设计和网络管理策略相匹配；对于动态分配，通常需要集成DHCP客户端；对于静态分配，需要确保配置的静态IP地址在网络中是唯一的，避免地址冲突。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">TCPIP_STATIC</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00035</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
