                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:74a4340d-0d68-8f39-52b3-6004a7a09f2d">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TCPIP_DHCP</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:cb23b6bf-6339-9851-76b1-0fe373f3375c">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TCPIP_IPV6_ROUTER</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:7443b2c6-bd0b-9aae-5a39-d45613b214fe">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TCPIP_LINKLOCAL</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:21e84ed1-6d48-93a3-4523-8dbb6e99f255">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TCPIP_LINKLOCAL_DOIP</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:3ff8e0fe-01a7-90f3-5e60-b451534ff408">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TCPIP_STATIC</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:13b5cec6-2809-48c5-83fd-a644fee37715">
                              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpAssignmentTrigger</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Trigger of address assignment.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpAssignmentTrigger配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中网络接口的IP地址分配机制，决定是静态分配还是动态获取（如DHCP）。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpAssignmentTrigger时，需确保网络接口与分配机制的兼容性；动态分配（DHCP）可能导致启动时延迟；静态分配需确保IP地址在网络中的唯一性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">TCPIP_MANUAL</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00036</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:6c665439-32ec-9e3a-6c62-b55b7421cdd7">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TCPIP_AUTOMATIC</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:72a6f8c0-f09d-9409-54a9-41b981ba0849">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TCPIP_MANUAL</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:308e8c12-6f3a-4981-ae9a-4aefd5cc577a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpStaticIpAddressConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container is a subcontainer of TcpIpLocalAddr and specifies a static IP address including directly related parameters.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpStaticIpAddressConfig 是一个配置项，用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中静态IP地址的配置，包括IP地址、子网掩码和默认网关。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置静态IP时，需要确保IP地址在网络中是唯一的，避免地址冲突；子网掩码需要正确配置以确保网络分割和通信的正确性；默认网关应当是可达的，且在同一子网内。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00034</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:21c013ab-03b6-45f6-b4d0-3fea2217c784">
                              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpNetmask</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Network mask of IPv4 address or address prefix of IPv6 address in CIDR Notation, i.e. decimal value between 0 and 32 (IPv4) or 0 and 128 (IPv6) that describes the number of significant bits defining the network number or prefix of an IP address.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpNetmask 配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中网络接口的子网掩码，它决定了网络的大小和主机地址的范围。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：子网掩码必须与网络的IP地址范围相匹配；在配置子网掩码时，应确保它符合CIDR（无类别域间路由）标准；在AUTOSAR环境中，确保子网掩码的配置与其他网络配置参数（如IP地址和网关）保持一致性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00039</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>128</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2a6fda22-afc0-46c4-a70d-f5a45ab7b066">
                              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpDefaultRouter</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">IP address of default router (gateway)</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpDefaultRouter 配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中的默认路由器的IP地址，这是网络通信中用于将数据包从一个网络转发到另一个网络的设备。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpDefaultRouter时，需要确保提供的IP地址与网络拓扑和地址分配方案相匹配；如果系统中存在多个网络接口，可能需要为每个接口配置不同的默认路由器；在动态IP环境下，如使用DHCP，应确保默认路由器的配置能够动态更新以适应可能的网络变化。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00040</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                              </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5f71ce83-a71b-414c-abf6-ae851fbb9088">
                              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpStaticIpAddress</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Static IP Address.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpStaticIpAddress配置项用于定义网络接口的静态IP地址配置，包括IP地址、子网掩码和默认网关地址，用于网络通信中的地址分配和路由选择。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用静态IP配置时，确保IP地址在网络中的唯一性，避免地址冲突；子网掩码需正确配置以确保网络分段正确；默认网关地址应指向可达的路由器接口，以保证外网通信的连通性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">To specify any IP address for a certain EthIfCtrl, &quot;ANY&quot; has to be set as wildcard. See TcpIp_Bind() for more details.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00038</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                              </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:cef19210-5c13-48d2-8ac1-634687151b47">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpNvmBlock</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of optional usage of Nvm in case the TcpIp module requires non volatile memory in the Ecu to store information (e.g. IP Address received via DHCP and shall be stored).</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpNvmBlock配置项用于定义TCP/IP模块中需要持久化存储的数据块，如IP地址配置、网关地址等，以保证系统在重启后能够恢复网络配置。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保NvmBlock描述符与实际的非易失性存储区域匹配；持久化数应仅包含对系统恢复至正常工作状态必要的配置；对于动态分配的IP地址，应考虑其在系统重启后的恢复策略。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00184</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:30f8464c-45d2-4664-8d68-cdf8b4cef9e9">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpNvmBlockDescriptorRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the Nvm block description in the Nvm module configuration.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpNvmBlockDescriptorRef 是一个配置项，用于引用网络管理向量（NVM）块描述符，该描述符定义了TCP/IP模块所需的非易失性存储数据。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpNvmBlockDescriptorRef时，必须确保引用的NVM块描述符已经在系统中定义且与TCP/IP模块的存储需求相匹配；此外，需要注意NVM块的读写权限和存储时机，以确保TCP/IP配置的正确性和数据的持久性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循模块间的依赖关系和接口规范，确保配置的一致性和兼容性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00185</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/NvM/NvMBlockDescriptor</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:cd6ac70a-b2f1-43f0-a670-0e23bdcd8ed1">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpPhysAddrConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the physical address configuration.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpPhysAddrConfig配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中网络接口的物理地址（如MAC地址）配置，包括静态或动态分配的物理地址。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：物理地址应遵循网络硬件的规范和标准；在配置动态物理地址时，需确保地址的唯一性和冲突避免机制；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应确保与网络管理和地址分配策略兼容。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00083</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:57b4619c-de15-4c90-990f-18f013ae859a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpPhysAddrChgHandler</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container is a subcontainer of TcpIpPhysAddrConfig and</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpPhysAddrChgHandler是一个配置项，用于指定当TCP/IP协议栈的物理地址（如MAC地址）发生变化时调用的回调函数，以便于上层软件组件能够响应这一变化。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpPhysAddrChgHandler时，需要确保提供的回调函数符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于物理地址变更处理函数的要求和接口规范；此外，应当考虑物理地址变更的影响范围，确保相关网络层和应用层组件能够正确处理地址变更事件；在实际部署时，还需注意硬件支持和网络管理策略，以确保物理地址变更能够被正确检测和处理。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">specifies the configuration parameters for physical address change handler.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00084</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:db125d73-14f0-4ccd-860d-9bbd9a02f5e6">
                              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpPhysAddrChgHandlerName</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the name of the physical address change function &lt;Up&gt;_PhysAddrTableChg.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpPhysAddrChgHandlerName配置项用于指定一个回调函数的名称，该函数在网络接口的物理地址（如MAC地址）发生变化时被调用，以便执行必要的更新或处理。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保指定的回调函数遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中定义的接口规范；物理地址变化可能来源于多种原因，如网络管理策略变更，因此需要仔细设计处理逻辑；在配置此项时，应确保网络堆栈已正确初始化并且能够处理地址变更事件。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00086</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                              </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c1ac5599-259c-4386-a39c-b3e3d86f4e7a">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpSocketOwnerConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the upper layer modules of TcpIp using the socket API.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpSocketOwnerConfig配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中的套接字所有者信息，包括所有者的标识符和其所拥有的套接字的配置。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个套接字所有者的标识符在系统中是唯一的；配置时需考虑系统中所有网络通信需求，以避免资源冲突；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求明确每个套接字所有者的角色和权限，以保障网络通信的安全性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00172</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:776cd4d4-1b75-41d5-a3f8-bc9e5224c2d8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpSocketOwner</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container is a subcontainer of TcpIpSocketOwnerConfig and specifies an upper layer of TcpIp that uses the socket API.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpSocketOwner配置项定义了拥有TCP/IP套接字的模块或组件，用于指定哪些模块可以创建和管理TCP/IP连接。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpSocketOwner时，需要确保指定的模块或组件已经包含了网络通信的功能和权限；此配置项对于网络通信的安全性和稳定性至关重要，需要仔细规划；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于TcpIpSocketOwner的配置和管理提供了详细的指导，确保遵循这些指导以保证系统的兼容性和性能。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00173</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:12d2393f-6e75-4294-a7b5-0a631ddda8d8">
                              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpSocketOwnerUpperLayerType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies the type of the upper layer module.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpSocketOwnerUpperLayerType配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中，上层所有者（如DoIP, HTTP, or SOME/IP）使用的套接字类型。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保上层协议与所选套接字类型兼容；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能对某些上层协议支持的套接字类型有具体要求或限制；正确配置此项对于网络通信的性能和稳定性至关重要。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">CDD</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00174</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
