                                  <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/KeyM/KeyMCertificate</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:52a02116-7733-405d-8962-65bf20ab84c2">
                              <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpTlsCiphersuiteDefinition</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container provides the static information of a ciphersuite used by TLS.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpTlsCiphersuiteDefinition 配置项用于定义TCP/IP协议栈中TLS(传输层安全协议)的加密套件，这些加密套件规定了加密算法、密钥交换方法、消息认证码和伪随机函数。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpTlsCiphersuiteDefinition时，需要确保选择的加密套件符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准以及相关安全标准和法规要求；应考虑到系统的性能和资源限制，选择合适的加密套件以平衡安全性和效率；还需注意加密套件的兼容性，确保与通信双方的TLS实现相匹配。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00237</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:06e5859f-1a34-4bf0-afb4-fb986897762a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpTlsUseAEADCipher</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Specifies if the ciphersuite supports AEAD for data en-/decryption.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpTlsUseAEADCipher 配置项指定了在使用传输层安全（TLS）协议时，是否启用基于认证加密的对称加密算法（AEAD），例如GCM（Galois/Counter Mode）或CCM（Counter with CBC-MAC）。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，支持AEAD加密算法是为了提供更高的安全性；配置时需要确保所选的加密套件与系统的安全需求相匹配；此外，使用AEAD加密算法可能需要更多的计算资源和内存，这在资源受限的嵌入式系统中需要特别考虑。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00247</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:73e58e1b-1f78-4854-805f-358a0b449b99">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpTlsUsePresharedKeys</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Defines if this ciphersuite uses pre-shared keys. If so, additional configuration or callbacks will be used for pre-shared key negotiation.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpTlsUsePresharedKeys 配置项用于指定TCP/IP协议栈是否使用预共享密钥（PSK）机制来建立TLS（传输层安全）连接，这是一种不依赖于证书的身份验证方法。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，使用预共享密钥的TLS配置必须确保密钥的安全存储和管理；此配置可能不适用于所有的安全通信场景，因为它可能不提供与证书基础结构相同的安全级别；在实施时，应考虑与其他安全措施（如密钥更新和撤销机制）的兼容性。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00245</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9ff2deb9-16a2-4895-a25c-82d424022c58">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpTlsUseSecurityExtensionForceMacThenHash</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Defines if the security extension according to IETF RFC 7366 shall be supported. This is useful for ciphersuites using CBC mode.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpTlsUseSecurityExtensionForceMacThenHash配置项用于指定在TLS（传输层安全协议）中，是否强制使用MAC-then-Hash（消息认证码后跟哈希）的安全扩展，以增强数据传输的安全性。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：此配置项对于确保数据在传输过程中的完整性和认证非常关键；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于安全相关的配置项要求非常严格，确保配置正确非常重要；如果系统对安全性要求较高，建议启用此选项。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00246</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f2d167ef-0b83-47bd-badb-3cf1d0606491">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpTlsVersion</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Declares the TLS version that this ciphersuite shall be used for.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpTlsVersion 配置项用于指定TCP/IP协议栈中TLS (Transport Layer Security) 的版本，这决定了通信安全协议的版本，以确保数据传输的安全性和兼容性。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保选择的TLS版本符合当前的安全标准和兼容性要求；过时的TLS版本可能不被支持，且可能存在安全风险；在配置时，还需考虑目标硬件和软件平台对TLS版本的支持情况。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00248</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
