                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c74a16e9-497c-4fb8-9d11-1720e1659a5a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpTlsConnectionGroup</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This optional container is used to collect all TlsConnections that belong to a TlsConnectionGroup. The intention of a TLS connection group is to share resources among TLS connections collected in a group, because only one connection of a group can be used at a time.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpTlsConnectionGroup配置项定义了一组TCP/IP连接的TLS（传输层安全协议）属性，用于确保数据传输的安全性和完整性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpTlsConnectionGroup时，必须确保所使用的TLS版本与AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准兼容；需要为每个需要加密的TCP/IP连接指定一个唯一的TcpIpTlsConnectionGroup；配置时应注意证书和密钥管理策略，以保障通信安全。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00224</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:1b6257be-27b9-4736-901b-324cae047b72">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpUdpConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the configuration parameters of the UDP (User Datagram Protocol) sub-module</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpUdpConfig配置项用于定义UDP协议栈的参数，包括端口号、目标IP地址、以及相关的接收和发送缓冲区大小等，确保UDP通信的正确性和性能。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpUdpConfig时，需确保端口号的唯一性，避免与系统中其他服务的端口号冲突；合理设置缓冲区大小，以避免数据丢失或额外的内存消耗；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对UDP的配置和管理提供了详细的指导，应遵循标准以确保兼容性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00026</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b2e70ba5-78e2-4710-a904-f37a9df21b6f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpUdpTtl</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Default Time-to-live value of outgoing UDP packets.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpUdpTtl配置项定义了UDP协议在IP网络中传输数据包时的生存时间（Time To Live，TTL），即数据包在网络中可以经过的最大路由器数目。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：TTL值过低可能导致数据包在到达目的地之前就被丢弃，特别是在跨越多个网络时；过高的TTL值可能导致无效或恶意的数据包在网络中过长时间流转，增加网络负担；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未对TcpIpUdpTtl的具体默认值或范围做出明确规定，需参考具体实现或网络环境要求进行配置。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00075</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:67f12d4b-a4db-4554-add7-f8359a9db309">
                  <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpGeneral</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container is a subcontainer of TcpIp and specifies the general configuration parameters of the TCP/IP stack.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpGeneral配置参数集合定义了TCP/IP协议栈的全局配置，包括协议栈的行为和性能特性。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpGeneral时，需要确保参数设置符合网络通信需求和资源限制；此外，应注意与其他网络管理配置的兼容性和一致性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能对某些参数的取值范围或默认值有特定要求，需要仔细核对标准文档。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00002</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:065ae087-b257-4646-b83d-455d4966a68b">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpDevErrorDetect</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Switches the development error detection and notification on or off.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpDevErrorDetect配置项用于启用或禁用TCP/IP协议栈中的开发错误检测功能，以便在开发阶段识别和报告潜在的错误。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在生产代码中通常禁用此功能以优化性能；确保在开发和测试阶段启用以捕获和修正错误；此配置项的使用应符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对错误检测和报告的规定。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: detection and notification is enabled.
                                        * false: detection and notification is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00004</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
