                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a82e1dff-772f-4c54-ba25-7f1f2260b108">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpResetIpAssignmentApi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables/disables the API TcpIp_ResetIpAssignment of a DHCP-client.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpResetIpAssignmentApi 配置项用于指定是否启用了一个API，该API允许上层协议栈动态地重置网络接口的IP地址分配。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保此API的使用与系统的IP地址管理策略一致；如果启用此API，需要确保网络管理和通信管理逻辑能够正确处理IP地址的动态变化；在设计网络接口管理时，考虑到重置IP分配可能对现有通信会话产生的影响。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00182</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cfe06c7d-0f46-4f49-a9ad-412eaff5f453">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpTcpEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables (TRUE) or disabled (FALSE) support of TCP (Transmission Control Protocol).</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpTcpEnabled配置项用于启用或禁用TCP/IP协议栈中的TCP协议支持，决定系统是否支持TCP协议的数据传输。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在不需要TCP协议支持的应用中禁用此项可以节省系统资源；确保在需要TCP通信的应用中启用此项；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项的使用与属性应与标准文档保持一致，避免配置错误导致的通信问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00008</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7dc73a4d-cd28-452d-98ff-a47b1c89e568">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpUdpEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables (TRUE) or disabled (FALSE) support of UDP (User Datagram Protocol)</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpUdpEnabled 配置项用于启用或禁用UDP协议模块，决定是否在AUTOSAR TCP/IP协议栈中包含对UDP通信的支持。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在不需要UDP通信的系统中可以禁用此功能以节省资源；如果项目需求包括UDP通信，则必须启用此配置；在配置时应确保与系统中其他网络配置项的兼容性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00009</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9b33c160-203c-4d08-8908-a08e940e422b">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpScalabilityClass</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">In order to customize the TcpIp Stack to the specific needs of the user it can be scaled according to the scalability classes.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpScalabilityClass 是一个配置参数，用于指定TCP/IP协议栈的可伸缩性类别，以适应不同的网络性能和资源需求。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在选择TcpIpScalabilityClass时，需要考虑ECU的资源限制和网络通信的性能要求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中定义了不同的可伸缩性类别，每个类别对应不同的功能和资源使用情况；确保选择的可伸缩性类别与实际应用场景相匹配，以避免资源浪费或性能不足。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">SC1</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00169</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:129729ea-d37a-879b-56a1-e31ee8db6e11">
                          <SHORT-NAME>SC1</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:da67d24c-d1ef-8eec-3987-3af3e3a6b5b8">
