                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:396c9f1b-732d-418a-ab6c-b89dd3fd0953">
                      <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpIpV6General</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container is a subcontainer of TcpIp and specifies the general configuration parameters of the TCP/IP stack for IPv6.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpIpV6General配置项定义了TCP/IP协议栈中IPv6通信的一般属性，包括IPv6地址配置、多播支持和邻居发现协议等。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置TcpIpIpV6General时，需要确保IPv6功能与项目需求相符，并且与网络硬件和底层驱动兼容；IPv6地址配置应遵循网络规划，避免地址冲突；在启用IPv6功能时，应注意资源消耗和性能影响，以及与IPv4的协同工作。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00164</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:607ae0fd-d339-4a35-982c-aed1e993ca88">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpDhcpV6ClientEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Enables (TRUE) or disables (FALSE) the DHCPv6 (Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol for IPv6) Client.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpDhcpV6ClientEnabled 配置项用于启用或禁用IPv6网络上的DHCP（Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol）客户端功能，允许自动获取网络配置参数，如IP地址。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用IPv6网络并需要动态IP地址分配时启用此功能；确保网络环境支持DHCPv6服务；在不需要动态地址分配或使用静态IP配置的场景中应禁用此功能以节省资源。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00093</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:456bc15e-9a05-4867-b82e-8e7d54c8a52f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpIpV6Enabled</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Enables (TRUE) or disables (FALSE) support of IPv6 (Internet Protocol version 6).</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpIpV6Enabled 配置项用于启用或禁用TCP/IP协议栈中IPv6的支持，允许网络通信通过IPv6地址进行。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保在使用IPv6功能时，相关的模块和功能也支持IPv6；如果项目不需要IPv6，可以禁用以节省资源；在配置时要考虑与IPv4的兼容性和网络架构的要求。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00089</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ecb55fe3-b365-4d93-a0ea-22bf35da3c30">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpIpV6PathMtuDiscoveryEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Enables (TRUE) or disables (FALSE) Path MTU Discovery support for IPv6 according to IETF RFC 1981.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpIpV6PathMtuDiscoveryEnabled配置项用于启用或禁用IPv6路径最大传输单元（Path MTU）发现机制，该机制旨在发现并使用最佳的数据包大小，以避免在传输路径中的分片，提高网络效率。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项对于支持IPv6的系统是必要的，以确保网络通信的高效性；不正确的配置可能导致数据传输效率低下或通信失败；在不支持IPv6的系统中，此配置项应被禁用或忽略。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00090</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
