                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2f6873a5-006e-4452-b06c-73437c38ad40">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpNdpAddressResolutionUnrechabilityDetectionEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Enables (TRUE) or disables (FALSE) support of Address Resoultion and Neighbor Unreachability Detetion via NDP.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpNdpAddressResolutionUnrechabilityDetectionEnabled配置项用于启用或禁用TCP/IP协议栈中的邻居发现协议(NDP)的地址解析和不可达性检测功能，以确定目标IPv6地址是否可达。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置IPv6网络通信时，此项至关重要；不正确的配置可能导致网络通信故障；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准支持此配置，但实现时需考虑对网络性能的影响。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00091</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:79763be0-9b78-486e-87ca-8b3a585139f7">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpNdpPrefixAndRouterDiscoveryEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Enables (TRUE) or disables (FALSE) support of Prefix and Router Discovery via NDP.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpNdpPrefixAndRouterDiscoveryEnabled配置项用于启用或禁用TCP/IP协议栈中的邻居发现协议(NDP)前缀和路由器发现功能，这对于IPv6网络配置是必要的。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用IPv6地址配置时，确保此配置与网络需求一致；禁用此功能可能导致IPv6网络连接问题；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对此功能的支持是可选的，具体实现依赖于软件供应商。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00092</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ed93845c-d9d9-4d06-b30a-58992edffcab">
                          <SHORT-NAME>TcpIpLocalAddrIpv6EntriesMax</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Maximum number of LocalAddr table entries for IPv6.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：TcpIpLocalAddrIpv6EntriesMax 配置项用于指定系统中每个IPv6本地地址所能拥有的最大IPv6地址条目数量，这影响着网络接口能够处理的IPv6地址的多样性和数量。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需考虑系统的内存限制和网络需求，以确保分配的地址条目既能满足网络通信需求，又不会过多消耗系统资源；此配置项的值应与实际网络架构和预期的网络负载相匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保此配置项的值不超过标准所定义的最大限制，如果有的话。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_TcpIp_00017</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
